# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# agent/ -- agent-authored material that is NOT part of the DAQ itself: the
# findings log, the raw bench captures it cites, and the throwaway analysis
# scripts. Kept in one folder so it is trivial to exclude, back up, or delete
# wholesale.
#   agent/AGENT.md          findings log (searchable, never auto-loaded)  TRACKED
#   agent/data/             CLI trace captures, model backups, renderings IGNORED
#   agent/plot_capture.py   capture -> one-axes timing diagram            tracked
# agent/AGENT.md was originally ignored; the rule was REMOVED on 2026-10-14 so the
# log is version-controlled with the tools that cite it. It is still never
# auto-loaded -- that is a property of the session file, not of git.
# A fresh clone cannot re-verify the trapezoid against hardware without
# agent/data/ -- the captures are machine-local by deliberate choice.
# NOTE: agent/trapezoid_gui.py was MOVED BACK to Aux/ on 2026-10-13: it is a
# user-facing teaching tool about the trapezoid filter, not agent scratch, so it
# belongs with the other Aux/ tools and is tracked there.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
agent/data/
agent/__pycache__/
__pycache__/

